    <string name="ob_lead">A museum of your own collection, however odd it is.</string>
    <string name="ob_1t">Things stand on shelves</string>
    <string name="ob_1b">Photograph a thing, the background goes, and it stands in a walnut cabinet with its own number.</string>
    <string name="ob_2t">«Do I have it?» in a second</string>
    <string name="ob_2b">At a flea market, photograph the thing: the lens checks every shelf and says where yours lives.</string>
    <string name="ob_3t">A card for every thing</string>
    <string name="ob_3b">Where from, when, how much, where it’s kept, its story. Empty cards stand under dust covers.</string>
    <string name="ob_4t">The museum grows</string>
    <string name="ob_4b">From a cabinet in the hall to a building with a crest. Visitors come, exhibitions open.</string>
